cff-version: 1.2.0
title: A logarithmic takum multiplier in VHDL
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Veran
    given-names: Leticia
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
license: ISC
repository-code: "https://github.com/LeticiaVeran/takum-multiplier-vhdl"
abstract: >-
  A multiplier for the logarithmic takum number format, written in VHDL-2008
  and integrated with the official takum codec (Takum-Codec-RTL, L. Hunhold).
  Verified exhaustively at 8 bits and by sampling up to 64 bits against an
  independent Python reference model, and synthesised for an Artix-7 FPGA.
keywords:
  - takum
  - logarithmic number system
  - VHDL
  - FPGA
  - computer arithmetic
references:
